            <note label="manuscript" type="description">Gradual-troper of Nevers, 12th century; French neumes (points liés) on a red F line, a yellow c line and dry-point lines. The gradual for SS. Marius and Martha, f. 31r.</note>
            <note label="manuscript" type="title">Gradual-troper of Nevers</note>
